@ReportServer_HostAddress = http://localhost:5054

### A PDF report with data
POST {{ReportServer_HostAddress}}/reports/helloreport
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "My Report"
}

### The same report as HTML
POST {{ReportServer_HostAddress}}/reports/helloreporthtml
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "My Report"
}

### A report whose JavaScript must finish before the PDF is printed
POST {{ReportServer_HostAddress}}/reports/asyncjavascriptreport
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Sales by region",
  "delayMilliseconds": 500
}
